            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rock_lobster"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Peas Rice Haiku: \"Delicate flavor. Didn't expect so subtle, with all those spices.\" I thought this was a lovely and light side dish that would complement just about any entree (we had it w/ meatloaf, green beans, and sweet potatoes.) I was very surprised at how subtle the flavor was despite the aroma being so enticingly strong. My daughter didn't like it one bit, but both my husband and I did, although when I make it again, I would increase the peas as they were little green dots of color and didn't really provide much greeny goodness.",
            "datePublished": "2015-02-20T10:52:13.347Z"
